WEBVTT

01:17:32.055 --> 01:17:36.892
And you're miles and miles
from your nice, warm bed

01:17:36.977 --> 01:17:40.396
You just remember
what your old pal said

01:17:40.480 --> 01:17:43.274
Boy, you've got a friend in me

01:17:44.776 --> 01:17:48.446
Yeah, you've got a friend in me

01:17:53.827 --> 01:17:56.829
You've got a friend in me

01:17:58.040 --> 01:18:00.624
You've got a friend in me
